Syntax: cast 'acid blast'

Acid Blast conjures a shower of caustic acid that rains down upon all enemies
in the caster's immediate vicinity. The corrosive liquid sears exposed flesh
and damages equipment, making this spell particularly effective against lightly
armored foes.

This area effect spell damages all hostile creatures in the room. The acid is
magically generated and dissipates quickly, but not before inflicting
significant harm. Equipment struck by the acid may suffer corrosion damage
over time.

Acid Blast is commonly used when facing multiple opponents, as its area effect
can strike several enemies simultaneously. The spell works best in enclosed
spaces where victims cannot easily escape the acid rain.

See Also: ICE STORM, ARCTIC BLAST, GUSHER
